External principles with workplace examples:
1. Intensity (loud shouts, flashing red alarms);
2. Size (large billboard vs classified ad);
3. Contrast (block letters on colored background, sudden factory silence);
4. Repetition (repeated safety warnings);
5. Motion (conveyor belt items vs stationary machines);
6. Novelty/Familiarity (introducing new software).

